      "title": "Data Governance | Saint Mary's College",
      "url": "https://www.stmarys-ca.edu/offices-services/academic-affairs/institutional-and-educational-effectiveness/data-governance",
      "summary": "The Data Governance page at Saint Mary's College of California outlines the institution's approach to managing and utilizing data as a strategic asset. The Data Governance Committee collaborates with IEE and AIS to ensure data integrity, security, and effective usage across the institution's various operational phases, including collection, pathways, integration, analysis, and distribution. The page also specifies policies related to instructional programs, data definitions, access privileges, and the roles of various teams and offices in maintaining the institution's data governance framework.",
      "stored": false,
